=== A3: Security, sensitivity and permissions ===
--- A3-b1: Paths/datasets carry sensitivity/access classification ---
Repository contract has 19 path rules
  pattern=src/** class=source namespace=product
  pattern=governance/kernel/** class=authoritative namespace=governance
  pattern=governance/project/** class=authoritative namespace=governance
  pattern=governance/generated/** class=generated namespace=governance
  pattern=governance/framework.lock class=authoritative namespace=governance

--- A3-b2: Secret/credential/restricted content excluded ---
SECURITY_POLICY.never_index_classes:
  never_index_classes: ['secret', 'restricted']
  never_export_classes: ['secret', 'restricted', 'confidential']
  secret_path_patterns: ['**/.env', '**/.env.*', '**/*.pem', '**/*.key', '**/id_rsa*', '**/secrets/**', '**/*secret*.yaml', '**/*secret*.yml', '**/*secret*.json', '**/*credentials*']

--- A3-b3: Restricted namespaces cannot be weakened by project overrides ---
Tested in A1 probe: SECURITY_POLICY.never_index_classes is additive mode (cannot remove entries)

--- A3-b4: Tool execution respects role/authority/permission boundaries ---
error [AUTHORITY_DENIED]: role 'research-agent' (L1) may not perform 'emergency_control' (requires L3); AUTHORITY_POLICY.authority_levels_required
role: research-agent
level: L1
required: L3
operation: emergency_control

--- A3-b5: Destructive/elevated operations require correct gates ---
INV-008: Human Decision Gates must be presented (not just file-based)
Authority levels from ROLES.yaml:
  research-agent: L1, backend-engineer: L1, orchestrator: L4, human: L5
Emergency control requires L3+ (AUTHORITY_POLICY)

--- A3-b6: Outbound/export controls are default-deny ---
upstream_export_mode: None
upstream_never_export: None
=== A3 Probe Complete ===
